{"id":"n57882-1-7","stage":5,"title":"방망이 · 棒子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57882-1-7-1","ko":"손에 들고 있는 길쭉한 물건은 뭐야?","zh":"你手里拿的那个长条状的东西是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손에","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손에","audio":"/audio/4f0dd1c88de503ae82f3.mp3"}},{"text":"들고","meaning":"带，提，拎","explanation":"들다：带，提，拎；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들고","audio":"/audio/3d6ddd0808b42a3e0c7e.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"길쭉한","meaning":"稍长","explanation":"길쭉하다：稍长；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"길쭉하다","audio":"/audio/f05e7d1fd5f9970ba832.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45115","senseId":"1","lemma":"길쭉하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길쭉한","audio":"/audio/bd37f8b3dfb2a579adef.mp3"}},{"text":"물건은","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건은","audio":"/audio/2e3ce52c4ab7fb078a0e.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"带，提，拎","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"手里拿着。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f05e7d1fd5f9970b","term":"길쭉하다","zh":"稍长","audio":"/audio/f05e7d1fd5f9970ba832.mp3","entryId":"45115","definition":"略微长。","pronunciation":["길쭈카다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/adfeeedf27c6f408581b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57882-1-7-2","ko":"야구 방망이야. 오늘 친구들과 야구를 하기로 했거든.","zh":"是棒球棒。我今天约了朋友们一起打棒球。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야구","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}},{"text":"방망이야.","meaning":"棒子，棒槌","explanation":"방망이：棒子，棒槌；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"방망이","audio":"/audio/641d74a9bc1d698a284b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57882","senseId":"1","lemma":"방망이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방망이야","audio":"/audio/466aa9e8118b0acf11a0.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"친구들과","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들과","audio":"/audio/5b2aa022738dba43cb55.mp3"}},{"text":"야구를","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야구를","audio":"/audio/ff86ad6c2ddf8d3855cb.mp3"}},{"text":"하기로","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하기로","audio":"/audio/9aafd710e747eae2aecc.mp3"}},{"text":"했거든.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했거든","audio":"/audio/5a949178dfbf10884d79.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7403c43735a4108c","term":"야구","zh":"棒球","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3","entryId":"62512","definition":"各由九名队员组成的两队轮流攻守，用棍子击打对方选手投出的球并绕竞技场一周即可得分的比赛。","pronunciation":["야ː구"]},{"id":"641d74a9bc1d698a","term":"방망이","zh":"棒子，棒槌","audio":"/audio/641d74a9bc1d698a284b.mp3","entryId":"57882","definition":"用于捶打的又长又圆的工具。","pronunciation":["방망이"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把某事定下来。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8159dee32c06b5b29a62.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.449,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57882","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":166,"sequenceScore":3.2757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是棒球棒。我今天约了朋友们一起打棒球。","为什么承奎会被怀疑是小偷啊？","你手里拿的那个长条状的东西是什么？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是棒球棒。我今天约了朋友们一起打棒球。","你手里拿的那个长条状的东西是什么？","为什么承奎会被怀疑是小偷啊？"],"answer":0}]}
